gmentation/\">BIM Staff Augmentation</a></li><li><a class=\"u\" href=\"/bim-staffing/mobilization/\">BIM Workforce Mobilization</a></li><li><a class=\"u\" href=\"/bim-staffing/workforce-continuity/\">BIM Workforce Continuity</a></li><li><a class=\"u\" href=\"/bim-staffing/temporary/\">Temporary BIM Staffing</a></li><li><a class=\"u\" href=\"/bim-staffing/long-term/\">Long-Term BIM Staffing</a></li><li><a class=\"u\" href=\"/bim-staffing/technical-recruitment/\">BIM Technical Recruitment</a></li></ul></div>\n  </div>\n</div></section>\n\n<section class=\"pad\"><div class=\"wrap\">\n  <div class=\"head\"><div><p class=\"lab\">Need a package instead?</p><h2 class=\"h2\">Related <em>BIM services.</em></h2></div><a class=\"btn ghost\" href=\"/bim-services/\">All BIM services <i aria-hidden=\"true\">&#8599;</i></a></div>\n  <ul class=\"rel\"><li><a href=\"/bim-services/architectural-bim/\" style=\"display:contents\"><b>Architectural BIM</b><span>Architecture</span><span class=\"l\">&rarr;</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/bim-services/interior-fitout/\" style=\"display:contents\"><b>Interior Fit-Out &#038; Joinery Drawings</b><span>Interiors</span><span class=\"l\">&rarr;</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/bim-services/bim-modeling/\" style=\"display:contents\"><b>BIM Modeling</b><span>Modelling</span><span class=\"l\">&rarr;</span></a></li></ul></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"paper pad\"><div class=\"wrap\">\n  <div class=\"head\"><div><p class=\"lab\">From the portfolio</p><h2 class=\"h2\">Where this work <em>was delivered.</em></h2></div><a class=\"btn dark\" href=\"/case-studies/#register\">Portfolio register <i aria-hidden=\"true\">&#8599;</i></a></div>\n  <ul class=\"rel\"><li><a href=\"/case-studies/reem-mall-abu-dhabi/\" style=\"display:contents\"><b>Reem Mall</b><span>Abu Dhabi</span><span class=\"l\">LOD 500</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/case-studies/enoc-staff-accommodation/\" style=\"display:contents\"><b>ENOC Staff Accommodation</b><span>Dubai</span><span class=\